---
# shapes_index.md.tmpl — SA-15 exemplar projection (2026-11-03).
#
# FM-PACK-005 requires >=1 templates/*.tmpl per pack. This is the pack's
# minimal, deterministic exemplar: one row per closed admission shape,
# projected as a markdown index. THE ONTOLOGY IS THE SOURCE: this template
# reads the same sh:NodeShape declarations the term-closure gate constrains.
# Never hand-edit rendered output; regeneration must be byte-identical.
to: "generated/smalt-core-shapes.md"
sparql: |
  PREFIX sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#>
  PREFIX dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>
  SELECT ?shape ?target WHERE {
    ?shape a sh:NodeShape ; sh:targetClass ?target .
  } ORDER BY ?target
---
# smalt-core-pack admission shapes

{% for r in results -%}
- {{ r.target }} — shaped by {{ r.shape }}
{% endfor -%}
